        "original_id": "6f1cc399-2f83-5303-8cf6-25131cd2a76f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michel Foucault\n- Organizations: Collège de France\n- Projects: The History of Sexuality\n- Products: The Will to Knowledge\n- Concepts: Biopower\n\nFacts:\n- Michel Foucault first used the term biopower in his lecture courses at the Collège de France.\n- In 1976, Michel Foucault's first volume of The History of Sexuality, The Will to Knowledge (La volonté de savoir), was first published.\n- The term biopower first appeared in print in The Will to Knowledge, the first volume of The History of Sexuality.\n- In 1978, an English translation of The Will to Knowledge appeared.",
